{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃん！！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/08/1709157/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会予告してた動物は猫でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え？ハロウィン？遅くね？\nという恥ずかしさにたえ\nハロウィン後夜祭しました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/08/1709157/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レオパード柄ファースカート"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/08/1709157/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴以外全部Bonbonコーデだよっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手来てくれた方ありがとう...❤︎❤︎\nまた愛にきてね、、？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/08/1709157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木のの公開収録、、\nＷひなでMCさせてもらったよo(｡･‧̫･｡)o\n大好きなラジオできるのは嬉しいこと。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/08/1709157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"富士急！！来たら、戦慄迷宮いきたくなるよね！！！行きたかったな～怖いの好き～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/08/1709157/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/08/1709157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"溺れるナイフを先日見にいきました。\n大好きな小松菜奈ちゃん、、素敵だったな～\n人に溺れてく姿とナイフみたいな青春がなんだか刺さり、涙とまんなかった～、、コウちゃんと望月さんの尊さよ～～、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして縷縷夢兎を着ている\n小松菜奈ちゃんをみれたことと、\n堀越千史ちゃんが歌う\n大森靖子さんの曲が流れることも最高だし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出演者がとりあえず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後得でしかなかったから\n山戸結希監督最高！！！！\nハルジオンのときも素敵pvだったしな～～\n山戸さんと趣味あうな～～嬉しいな～～\nいつか私も山戸さんに関わりたいな～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/08/1709157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/08/1709157/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブランコのショートMV見た人？\n気づいたかな？？？\nあだ名が川後Pになってた！\n一応、公式ニックネームが\nひなぴょんなんだけどねっ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、\n縄使いやってるよ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"縄で捕まえんぞ！えいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/08/1709157/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ見てない人はみてみてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち。"}],"source":"archive"}